te: Please make sure he wears glasses.\n\nPersonality (We will add this information to create an image)\nA character of a hardworking squire who is often pushed around by a younger master.\nFirst person is me.\nShe is good with money, dexterous with her hands, a medicine-user type, and a wizard who is not good at magic.\nShe is a magician who is good with money, good with her hands, good with medicine, and not very good with magic.\nThe worldview of the original system is high fantasy with swords and magic.\n\nI want her to wear cool clothes with little skin exposure.\nI like Hoya's use of color, touch of line, expression of texture of materials, design of clothes, etc. (I've seen that too much ・・・・・・・), so I'd be happy if you could give her the usual look!\n\nIf you don't feel like it or it's not convenient for you, please feel free to kick me.\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/C5lZCFqU0AERC32?format=jpg", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Y_ao_H/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1983482, "client_id": 1920716, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/532317a6/uploads/origins/3193ce74-9ad9-44a3-8e42-eb438f4d0a65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6259e912f0d3a4ad2796a2537e4b278f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/532317a6/uploads/origins/3193ce74-9ad9-44a3-8e42-eb438f4d0a65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6259e912f0d3a4ad2796a2537e4b278f, https://si.imgix.net/532317a6/uploads/origins/3193ce74-9ad9-44a3-8e42-eb438f4d0a65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d39061df9ca8f436f83e21d77829adc1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/532317a6/uploads/origins/3193ce74-9ad9-44a3-8e42-eb438f4d0a65?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=347